      "Structural roles (organizer, shaper, terminal)",
      "Lineup composition",
      "Player talent",
      "Talent control/management"
    ],
    "methodological_questions": [
      "Definition and assignment of player roles (organizer, shaper, terminal)",
      "Measurement of lineup coverage based on specific roles",
      "Separability of structural role coverage from individual player talent",
